@startuml
title CON-SD-D01 Continuity Logical Architecture
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Central PMS\n<<degraded resolve + payment finality + fiscal reference + ExitAuthorization authority>>" as Central
component "Vendor PMS / HCP\n<<normal session + tariff authority>>" as Vendor
component "Vendor PMS / HikCentral Connector\nfacts + health + freshness only" as Connector
component "Projection\noperational visibility / degraded support only" as Projection
component "Payment Orchestrator\nverified provider outcome reporter" as Pay
component "Site POS Server\n<<Sales Invoice authority>>" as POS
component "Continuity Terminal\nrestricted APT mode, disabled by default" as CT
component "Operator Console\n<<non-payment governance>>" as OC
component "Management Dashboard\n<<visibility only>>" as Dash
component "Gate / Exit\nconsumes Central PMS authorization" as Gate
component "Audit / Event" as Audit
component "Reconciliation workflow" as Recon

Connector --> Vendor : vendor interaction
Connector --> Projection : projection inputs
Projection --> Central : freshness/support context
Central --> Connector : live resolve / degraded context request
Central --> Pay : payment workflow
Central --> POS : fiscal issuance request
Central --> CT : restricted status / allowed workflow context
OC --> Central : governance decisions where approved
Central --> Gate : ExitAuthorization when eligible
Central --> Audit
CT --> Audit
OC --> Audit
Audit --> Recon
Central --> Dash : source-labeled visibility

note bottom
Continuity is explicit controlled degraded operation.
It is not silent fallback or automatic fallback.
end note
@enduml
